; Goliff et al. (2013), Atmos. Environ.; F0AM version (S. R., M. M., G. M. Wolfe, 2015-2016, with the corrections listed in its header).  F0AM: Wolfe et al. (2016), github.com/AirChem/F0AM, GPL-3.0.
; source files sha256[:16]: RACM2_AllRxns.m 74850b8b2da16cc1, RACM2_K.m 6b2a19be13049eaf, RACM2_J.m 5074e56adce9cfee
; physics: air density from the pressure and temperature settings, F0AM's constant species
CONST=FUNCTION[%1]
DENSITY=FUNCTION[(%1)/((%2)*1.379E-19)]
M =DENSITY(P,T)
O2=CONST(0.2095*M)
N2=CONST(0.7808*M)
